    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Note that this will drop the old global thread pool (tp) and create a new tp - which means that any loggers that use the old tp will stop working, so it is advised calling it before any async loggers created.",
          "position": {
            "start": {
              "line": 65,
