    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "If different loggers must have separate queues, different instances of pools can be created and passed them to the loggers:",
          "position": {
            "start": {
              "line": 67,
              "column": 1,
              "offset": 4041
            },
            "end": {
              "line": 67,
              "column": 124,
              "offset": 4164
            }
